{
  "description": "Scoped to the three ways an OBS→YouTube stream drops frames: (1) internal network congestion exceeding OBS's send buffer, (2) the YouTube endpoint disconnecting, and (3) OBS itself failing to send frames. All series derive from obs.scrape and obs.stream_state_changed log events emitted by obs-studio-otel. General health / built-in-editor metrics (render-thread frames, FPS, render time, memory, bytes) are intentionally excluded.",
